.env.*.bak
**/.env.*.bak
.env.cloud.*
# Backup title cloud (dữ liệu nội bộ, dùng rollback backfill)
**/title_backup_cloud*.json

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

